@base = http://127.0.0.1:8081

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Read fixtures
GET {{base}}/api/tickets?status=OPEN&sort=priorityDesc
### Create; use the returned ID below
# @name createTicket
POST {{base}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{"externalRef":"INC-200","title":"Scanner disconnected","priority":4}
### Read created row
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}
### Replace mutable fields
PUT {{base}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Scanner connected","priority":2,"status":"RESOLVED"}
### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/api/tickets/{{createTicket.response.body.$.id}}
### Documented invalid input
GET {{base}}/api/tickets?sort=unknown
### Missing row
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/9999
